    'COLONOSCOPY AND THERAPEUTIC IBD ENDOSCOPY REPORT\n'
    'Patient: Elena Brooks, 52-year-old woman\n'
    'Date of service: November 8, 2026 | Procedure location: Advanced Endoscopy Unit\n'
    'Endoscopist: E. Morgan, MD | Referring physician: R. Chen, MD\n'
    'Procedure: High-definition ileocolonoscopy with therapeutic intervention and dysplasia surveillance\n'
    'Reason for referral: Symptomatic ileocolonic anastomotic narrowing in established Crohn disease; surveillance for\n'
