    'splenic-flexure lesion. Histopathology was pending at the time this report was finalized.\n'
    'Technical outcome and immediate complications\n'
    'The anastomotic narrowing was successfully dilated to 15 mm and subsequently traversed. The 23 mm distal\n'
    'transverse-colon lesion was removed by piecemeal mucosal resection, and the separate 9 mm descending-colon\n'
